      "category": "etymology",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "text": "The entire island was bought by an entrepreneur in 1946 with plans to build 200 homes, but this attempt was abandoned due to the cost of a sewer system.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        5
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Ketron_Island%2C_Washington",
      "category": "history",
      "quality": "poor",
      "qualityReason": "vague"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "Ketron Island is accessible only by ferry, which runs four times per day between 5:45 AM and 8:00 PM every day.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        16,
